      reveal_market: 'Arizona Pitch has no market; the kitty is taken by the bid winner.',
      buy_market: 'There is no market or card purchase; the bid winner takes the kitty.',
      buy_stock: 'Players do not buy from stock; the bid winner takes the kitty and discards five.',
      fold: 'Arizona Pitch is trick-taking; there is no fold; all four players play every hand.',
