      call: 'Arizona Pitch has no betting rounds; it uses bidding for trump, not call.',
      bet: 'Arizona Pitch has no betting; it uses bidding (1-5) for the right to pitch.',
      raise: 'There is no raise; only bidding for trump in Arizona Pitch.',
      declare: 'Arizona Pitch has no declaration phase; points are tallied after tricks.',
      reveal_hand: 'Reveal is implicit as cards are played to tricks; no separate reveal action.',
      award_pot: 'Scoring is performed by the system via calculate_setback_score, not a pot award.',
